.TH FL-RECORDER 1 "November 2026" "fldesktop 0.1.4" "fldesktop"
.SH NAME
fl-recorder \- sound recorder
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfl-recorder\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Records sound from the default microphone through GStreamer (PipeWire or
PulseAudio) with a level meter. \fBRecord\fR (or \fBSpace\fR) starts and stops;
the file goes to \fI$XDG_MUSIC_DIR/Recordings\fR, named after the date and
time. Formats: Opus (the default), FLAC, WAV and MP3 (needs the lame
GStreamer plugin).
.PP
The list shows the recordings, newest first: double-click one to play it; the
right-click menu renames it or moves it to the trash.
.SH FILES
.TP
\fI~/.config/fldesktop/recorder.ini\fR
The format last used.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBfl-mixer\fR(1), \fBfl-media-player\fR(1)
